     "design": "r0A",
     "good": "The Russian terms and Vietnamese equivalents remain intact on single lines, making each pair easy to scan. The description has a readable measure, and the rows remain clear.",
     "problems": "The Vietnamese column has some spare space that could give the prose a little more room.",
     "cause": "At 132px, column 2 is wider than needed for its 111px longest line plus 21px of padding and borders."
    },
    {
     "design": "r0B",
     "good": "The Russian terms remain intact, and the wider description column gives the prose a more comfortable measure.",
     "problems": "Two Vietnamese equivalents wrap, weakening the quick comparison between the paired terms without reducing the height of any row.",
     "cause": "At 90px, column 2 provides only 69px of text width; the space saved is assigned to the 322px description column."
    },
    {
     "design": "r0C",
     "good": "The Russian terms have ample room, and the table remains easy to follow across rows.",
     "problems": "Two Vietnamese equivalents wrap while conspicuous spare space sits beside the Russian terms. The narrower description column also makes the prose feel more compressed.",
     "cause": "Column 1 is 190px wide despite needing 155px to fit its longest term; column 2 is 112px and column 3 is 265px."
    }
   ],
   "done": false,
   "names": [
